   "contentHtml": "<h2 class=\"\" style=\"left: 47.48%; top: 12.396%;\" data-off-x=\"474.8\" data-off-y=\"123.96\" data-pose=\"\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Etude&nbsp;</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></h2><p class=\"lead taille-l\" style=\"left: 30.61%; top: 19.16%; max-width: 894.957px; width: 894.957px;\" data-off-x=\"306.1\" data-off-y=\"191.6\" data-pose=\"\"><span class=\"t-fr\">\"Do weather-related extreme events influence climate-related opinions? The case of the 2019–2020 Australian Black Summer bushfires\"</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p><div class=\"speaker-notes\" hidden=\"\">Do weather-related extreme events influence climate-related opinions? The case of the 2019–2020 Australian Black Summer bushfires · Andreotta et al., 2026 · file:///C:/Users/ASUS/OneDrive/Documents/Etudes/Psychology/Thesis/Articles/Articles CTs/Climate%20and%20Environment/Climate%20change%20denial/Andreotta%20et%20al.%20-%202026%20-%20Do%20weather-related%20extreme%20events%20influence%20climate-related%20opinions%20The%20case%20of%20the%202019-2020%20Australian%20Black%20Summer.pdf</div><div class=\"retourne step\" data-off-x=\"631.24\" data-off-y=\"322.67\" data-order=\"3\" style=\"left: 63.124%; top: 32.267%;\" data-pose=\"\"><div class=\"retourne-inner\"><div class=\"retourne-face retourne-recto\"><p class=\"lead al-centre taille-l pos-centre\" style=\"\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Les sceptiques</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p></div><div class=\"retourne-face retourne-verso\"><p class=\"lead\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Doutent de l'origine humaine<br>S'inquiètent peu des conséquences du changement climatique<br>Sont \"conservateurs\" (droite)<br>Pensent que l'environnement se remet de tout<br>(environment-as-elastic)</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p></div></div></div><div class=\"retourne step\" data-off-x=\"402.6\" data-off-y=\"322.67\" style=\"left: 40.26%; top: 32.267%;\" data-order=\"2\" data-pose=\"\"><div class=\"retourne-inner\"><div class=\"retourne-face retourne-recto\"><p class=\"lead taille-l\" style=\"\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Les hésitants</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p></div><div class=\"retourne-face retourne-verso\"><p class=\"lead\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Pas de profil type<br>MAIS plus complotistes</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p></div></div></div><div class=\"retourne step\" data-off-x=\"173.5\" data-off-y=\"322.67\" style=\"left: 17.35%; top: 32.267%;\" data-order=\"1\" data-pose=\"\"><div class=\"retourne-inner\"><div class=\"retourne-face retourne-recto\"><p class=\"lead taille-l\" style=\"\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Les acceptants</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p></div><div class=\"retourne-face retourne-verso\"><p class=\"lead taille-s\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Ne doutent pas de l'origine humaine<br>S'inquiète des conséquences du changement climatique<br>Sont \"libéraux\" (gauche)<br>Pense que le monde a une capacité limitée pour s'adapter<br>(word-as-ductile)</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p></div></div></div><div class=\"retourne step\" data-off-x=\"173.25\" data-off-y=\"671.78\" style=\"left: 17.325%; top: 67.178%;\" data-animation=\"{&quot;effet&quot;:&quot;apparaitre&quot;,&quot;duree&quot;:700,&quot;declencheur&quot;:&quot;apparition&quot;,&quot;rang&quot;:5}\" data-order=\"4\" data-pose=\"\"><div class=\"retourne-inner\"><div class=\"retourne-face retourne-recto\"><p class=\"lead\" style=\"\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Avant</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p></div><div class=\"retourne-face retourne-verso\"></div></div></div><div class=\"retourne step\" data-off-x=\"402.34\" data-off-y=\"671.78\" style=\"left: 40.234%; top: 67.178%;\" data-animation=\"{&quot;effet&quot;:&quot;apparaitre&quot;,&quot;duree&quot;:700,&quot;declencheur&quot;:&quot;apparition&quot;,&quot;rang&quot;:7}\" data-order=\"6\" data-pose=\"\"><div class=\"retourne-inner\"><div class=\"retourne-face retourne-recto\"><p class=\"lead\" style=\"\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Après</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p></div><div class=\"retourne-face retourne-verso\"></div></div></div><div class=\"retourne step\" data-off-x=\"631.43\" data-off-y=\"671.78\" style=\"left: 63.143%; top: 67.178%;\" data-animation=\"{&quot;effet&quot;:&quot;apparaitre&quot;,&quot;duree&quot;:700,&quot;declencheur&quot;:&quot;apparition&quot;,&quot;rang&quot;:9}\" data-order=\"8\" data-pose=\"\"><div class=\"retourne-inner\"><div class=\"retourne-face retourne-recto\"><p class=\"lead\" style=\"\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Un mois plus tard</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p></div><div class=\"retourne-face retourne-verso\"></div></div></div>"
