   "contentHtml": "\n    <h2 data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"127.308\" data-off-y=\"88.889\" style=\"left:12.731%;top:8.889%;width:60.938%;max-width:none;font-size:61px\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Exemple concret.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></h2>\n    <p class=\"lead step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"127.308\" data-off-y=\"315.047\" style=\"left:12.731%;top:31.505%;width:59.127%;max-width:none;font-size:30px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">• Vous avez raté une promotion.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <p class=\"lead step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"127.308\" data-off-y=\"374.518\" style=\"left:12.731%;top:37.452%;width:59.127%;max-width:none;font-size:30px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">• Vous voyez votre collègue qui a un grand sourire.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <p class=\"lead step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"127.308\" data-off-y=\"433.989\" style=\"left:12.731%;top:43.399%;width:59.127%;max-width:none;font-size:30px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">• Conclusion :</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <p class=\"lead step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"127.308\" data-off-y=\"493.461\" style=\"left:12.731%;top:49.346%;width:59.127%;max-width:none;font-size:30px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">• 1) C’est car il sait que vous avez raté votre promotion (le méchant !)</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <p class=\"lead step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"127.308\" data-off-y=\"595.884\" style=\"left:12.731%;top:59.588%;width:59.127%;max-width:none;font-size:30px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">• 2) Il sait que c’est lui qui obtiendra votre promotion (le méchant !).</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <p class=\"lead step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"127.308\" data-off-y=\"698.306\" style=\"left:12.731%;top:69.831%;width:59.127%;max-width:none;font-size:30px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">• Véritable raison : sa fille lui a fait un dessin trop mignon ce matin et ça le rend heureux.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <div class=\"forme forme-ovale step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"500\" data-off-y=\"211.947\" style=\"left:50%;top:21.195%;background-color:#5FCBEF;width:17.583%;height:13.907%;max-width:none\"><span class=\"forme-texte\" style=\"color:#1b1b1b;font-size:30px\">Emotions</span></div>\n    <div class=\"forme forme-ovale step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"89.475\" data-off-y=\"138.351\" style=\"left:8.948%;top:13.835%;background-color:#2E946B;width:14.134%;height:13.907%;max-width:none\"><span class=\"forme-texte\" style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:30px\">Manque de contexte</span></div>\n    <div class=\"forme forme-ovale step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"340.404\" data-off-y=\"781.094\" style=\"left:34.04%;top:78.109%;background-color:#96D141;width:14.81%;height:15.438%;max-width:none\"><span class=\"forme-texte\" style=\"color:#1b1b1b;font-size:30px\">Conclusion hâtive (Système 1)</span></div>\n    <div class=\"forme forme-ovale step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"698.819\" data-off-y=\"557.706\" style=\"left:69.882%;top:55.771%;background-color:#2E83C3;width:14.675%;height:10.753%;max-width:none\"><span class=\"forme-texte\" style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:30px\">Biais de causalité</span></div>\n  "
