   "attrsRaw": "class=\"slide\" id=\"complotiste-situation-conflictuelle-du-deb\" data-serie=\"serie_74a8ae76-7828-4647-a311-fca59109f0dc\"",
   "contentHtml": "\n    <h2 data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"256.19\" data-off-y=\"46.759\" style=\"left:25.619%;top:4.676%;width:72.326%;max-width:none;font-size:74px\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Situation conflictuelle du débat.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></h2>\n    <p class=\"lead\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"138.372\" data-off-y=\"318.518\" style=\"left:13.837%;top:31.852%;width:72.326%;max-width:none;font-size:47px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">• Vous ne POUVEZ PAS gagner l’échange.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <p class=\"lead\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"138.372\" data-off-y=\"411.69\" style=\"left:13.837%;top:41.169%;width:72.326%;max-width:none;font-size:47px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">• Quitter l’affrontement en tête en tête.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <p class=\"lead\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"138.372\" data-off-y=\"504.862\" style=\"left:13.837%;top:50.486%;width:72.326%;max-width:none;font-size:47px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">• Ne pas chercher à écraser l’autre.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <p class=\"lead\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"138.372\" data-off-y=\"598.034\" style=\"left:13.837%;top:59.803%;width:72.326%;max-width:none;font-size:47px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">• Ne pas chercher à convaincre la personne.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <p class=\"lead\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"138.372\" data-off-y=\"691.206\" style=\"left:13.837%;top:69.121%;width:72.326%;max-width:none;font-size:47px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">• Ne pas imaginer un changement de conviction de manière binaire mais progressive.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <p class=\"lead\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"138.372\" data-off-y=\"851.668\" style=\"left:13.837%;top:85.167%;width:72.326%;max-width:none;font-size:47px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">• L’apprentissage et le changement d’idées erronées se fait sur le LONG TERME.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <div class=\"forme forme-ovale\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"92.599\" data-off-y=\"19.537\" style=\"left:9.26%;top:1.954%;background-color:#70AD47;width:12.482%;height:24.667%;max-width:none\"><span class=\"forme-texte\" style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:30px\">Contexte social</span></div>\n  "
