   "attrsRaw": "class=\"slide\" id=\"communiquer-les-sous-entendus-ce-que-l-on\"",
   "contentHtml": "\n    <h2 data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"127.308\" data-off-y=\"88.889\" style=\"left:12.731%;top:8.889%;width:59.127%;max-width:none;font-size:61px\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Les sous-entendus (ce que l’on veut faire comprendre)</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></h2>\n    <p class=\"lead step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"127.308\" data-off-y=\"315.047\" style=\"left:12.731%;top:31.505%;width:59.127%;max-width:none;font-size:30px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">• Tu es sûr que tu manges assez ?</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <p class=\"lead step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"127.308\" data-off-y=\"374.518\" style=\"left:12.731%;top:37.452%;width:59.127%;max-width:none;font-size:30px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">• Elle est gentille, Samantha, hein ?</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <p class=\"lead step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"127.308\" data-off-y=\"433.989\" style=\"left:12.731%;top:43.399%;width:59.127%;max-width:none;font-size:30px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">• Tu veux aller boire un verre après les cours ?</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n  "
