   "contentHtml": "\n    <h2 data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"127.308\" data-off-y=\"88.889\" style=\"left:12.731%;top:8.889%;width:59.127%;max-width:none;font-size:61px\"><span class=\"t-fr\">La valeur performative d’une phrase.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></h2>\n    <p class=\"lead step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"127.308\" data-off-y=\"315.047\" style=\"left:12.731%;top:31.505%;width:59.127%;max-width:none;font-size:30px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">• Aspect illocutoire</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <p class=\"lead step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"150.892\" data-off-y=\"374.518\" style=\"left:15.089%;top:37.452%;width:57.127%;max-width:none;font-size:30px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">– La fonction normative de la parole.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <p class=\"lead step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"127.308\" data-off-y=\"433.989\" style=\"left:12.731%;top:43.399%;width:59.127%;max-width:none;font-size:30px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">• Aspect perlocutoire</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <p class=\"lead step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"150.892\" data-off-y=\"493.461\" style=\"left:15.089%;top:49.346%;width:57.127%;max-width:none;font-size:30px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">– L’affect psychologique de nos paroles.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <p class=\"lead step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"150.892\" data-off-y=\"552.932\" style=\"left:15.089%;top:55.293%;width:57.127%;max-width:none;font-size:30px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">– Parfois le but n’est pas le sens de ce que l’on dit, mais de l’émotion que l’on produit.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n  "
