   "attrsRaw": "class=\"slide\" id=\"communiquer-consequence-pour-nous\"",
   "contentHtml": "\n    <h2 data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"127.308\" data-off-y=\"88.889\" style=\"left:12.731%;top:8.889%;width:59.127%;max-width:none;font-size:61px\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Conséquence pour nous</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></h2>\n    <p class=\"lead step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"127.308\" data-off-y=\"315.047\" style=\"left:12.731%;top:31.505%;width:59.127%;max-width:none;font-size:30px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">• Notre vision du réel dépend des éléments que nous avons perçu du réel.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <p class=\"lead step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"127.308\" data-off-y=\"417.469\" style=\"left:12.731%;top:41.747%;width:59.127%;max-width:none;font-size:30px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">• De part son expérience, chacun perçoit des éléments différents du réel.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <p class=\"lead step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"127.308\" data-off-y=\"519.892\" style=\"left:12.731%;top:51.989%;width:59.127%;max-width:none;font-size:30px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">• Et ceux-ci sont démultiplié par la répétition.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n  "
