   "contentHtml": "<h2 data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"261.04\" data-off-y=\"110.13\" style=\"left:26.104%;top:11.013%\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Comment diffuser l’information lorsqu’elle peut être conflictuelle ?</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></h2><p class=\"lead step\" data-order=\"1\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"408.69\" data-off-y=\"240.06\" style=\"left:40.869%;top:24.006%\"><span class=\"t-fr\"><b>Croyance</b> — personnelle ou religieuse.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"lead step\" data-order=\"2\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"356.74\" data-off-y=\"290.72\" style=\"left:35.674%;top:29.072%\"><span class=\"t-fr\"><b>Biais d’engagement</b> — on s’est investi dans cette conviction.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"lead step\" data-order=\"3\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"356.6\" data-off-y=\"341.38\" style=\"left:35.66%;top:34.138%\"><span class=\"t-fr\"><b>Contexte social</b> — difficulté d’admettre son erreur en public.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>"
