   "attrsRaw": "class=\"slide\" id=\"communiquer-humilite-epistemique\"",
   "contentHtml": "\n    <h2 data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"127.308\" data-off-y=\"88.889\" style=\"left:12.731%;top:8.889%;width:59.127%;max-width:none;font-size:61px\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Humilité épistémique</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></h2>\n    <p class=\"lead\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"127.308\" data-off-y=\"315.047\" style=\"left:12.731%;top:31.505%;width:59.127%;max-width:none;font-size:30px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">• Je ne sais pas tout.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <p class=\"lead\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"127.308\" data-off-y=\"374.518\" style=\"left:12.731%;top:37.452%;width:59.127%;max-width:none;font-size:30px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">• Je suis également biaisé.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <p class=\"lead\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"127.308\" data-off-y=\"433.989\" style=\"left:12.731%;top:43.399%;width:59.127%;max-width:none;font-size:30px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">• Je m’exprime parfois comme une huître sur les réseaux sociaux</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <p class=\"lead\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"127.308\" data-off-y=\"493.461\" style=\"left:12.731%;top:49.346%;width:59.127%;max-width:none;font-size:30px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">• Je peux tomber dans des pièges.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <p class=\"lead\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"127.308\" data-off-y=\"552.932\" style=\"left:12.731%;top:55.293%;width:59.127%;max-width:none;font-size:30px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">• L’autre sait peut être mieux que moi.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <p class=\"lead\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"127.308\" data-off-y=\"612.403\" style=\"left:12.731%;top:61.24%;width:59.127%;max-width:none;font-size:30px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">• La légitimité de ses opinions a autant de valeur que la mienne.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n  "
