   "contentHtml": "\n    <h2 data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"127.308\" data-off-y=\"88.889\" style=\"left:12.731%;top:8.889%;width:59.127%;max-width:none;font-size:61px\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Mariage</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></h2>\n    <p class=\"lead step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"127.308\" data-off-y=\"217.062\" style=\"left:12.731%;top:21.706%;width:59.127%;max-width:none;font-size:40px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">• Paul regarde Cléa</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <p class=\"lead step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"127.308\" data-off-y=\"296.357\" style=\"left:12.731%;top:29.636%;width:59.127%;max-width:none;font-size:40px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">• Cléa regarde Théo.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <p class=\"lead step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"127.308\" data-off-y=\"375.653\" style=\"left:12.731%;top:37.565%;width:59.127%;max-width:none;font-size:40px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">• Paul est marié, Théo ne l’est pas.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <p class=\"lead step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"127.308\" data-off-y=\"454.948\" style=\"left:12.731%;top:45.495%;width:59.127%;max-width:none;font-size:40px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">• Est-ce que dans cette situation, une personne mariée regarde une personne qui ne l’est pas ?</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <div class=\"forme forme-ovale step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"212.095\" data-off-y=\"782.938\" style=\"left:21.21%;top:78.294%;background-color:#5FCBEF;width:6.863%;height:13.333%;max-width:none\"><span class=\"forme-texte\" style=\"color:#1b1b1b;font-size:30px\">Paul</span></div>\n    <div class=\"forme forme-ovale step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"433.892\" data-off-y=\"641.481\" style=\"left:43.389%;top:64.148%;background-color:#5FCBEF;width:6.611%;height:14.146%;max-width:none\"><span class=\"forme-texte\" style=\"color:#1b1b1b;font-size:30px\">Cléa</span></div>\n    <div class=\"forme forme-ovale step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"633.47\" data-off-y=\"801.481\" style=\"left:63.347%;top:80.148%;background-color:#5FCBEF;width:6.863%;height:13.333%;max-width:none\"><span class=\"forme-texte\" style=\"color:#1b1b1b;font-size:30px\">Théo</span></div>\n    <p class=\"lead step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"218.847\" data-off-y=\"718.519\" style=\"left:21.885%;top:71.852%;width:5.428%;max-width:none;font-size:30px;border:2px solid #5FCBEF;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px;text-align:center\"><span class=\"t-fr\">marié</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <p class=\"lead step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"624.739\" data-off-y=\"741.962\" style=\"left:62.474%;top:74.196%;width:9.706%;max-width:none;font-size:30px;border:2px solid #5FCBEF;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px;text-align:center\"><span class=\"t-fr\">pas marié</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n  "
