   "contentHtml": "\n    <h2 data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"398.58\" data-off-y=\"110.13\" style=\"left:39.858%;top:11.013%\"><span class=\"t-fr\">On reprend les bases</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></h2><p class=\"lead taille-l step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"436.79\" data-off-y=\"182.8\" style=\"left:43.679%;top:18.28%\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Quelle est la source ?</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"lead taille-l step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"377.2\" data-off-y=\"242.27\" style=\"left:37.72%;top:24.227%\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Est-ce que l’interlocuteur est compétent ?</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"lead taille-l step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"416.41\" data-off-y=\"301.74\" style=\"left:41.641%;top:30.174%\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Est-ce qu’on a des preuves ?</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"lead taille-l step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"365.21\" data-off-y=\"361.21\" style=\"left:36.521%;top:36.121%\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Est-ce que beaucoup de journaux en parlent ?</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"lead taille-l step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"380.69\" data-off-y=\"420.68\" style=\"left:38.069%;top:42.068%\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Est-ce que l’information paraît crédible ?</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"lead taille-l step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"393.21\" data-off-y=\"480.15\" style=\"left:39.321%;top:48.015%\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Qu’est-ce qu’en pensent les autres ?</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n  "
