   "contentHtml": "\n    <style>\n#s-deux-facons-penser .compare{width:1060px;gap:100px;flex-wrap:nowrap}\n#s-deux-facons-penser .compare .col{width:480px}\n#s-deux-facons-penser .compare-img{height:240px}\n#s-deux-facons-penser .dp-carte{margin-top:22px;padding:22px 26px;border-radius:18px;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--bord);box-shadow:0 14px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n#s-deux-facons-penser .dp-carte.step{opacity:0;transform:perspective(900px) rotateX(-92deg);transform-origin:top center;transition:transform .9s cubic-bezier(.25,1.35,.45,1),opacity .25s ease}\n#s-deux-facons-penser .dp-carte.step.shown{opacity:1;transform:none}\n#s-deux-facons-penser .dp-titre{font-size:36px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 12px;max-width:none;line-height:1.2}\n#s-deux-facons-penser .dp-texte{font-size:30px;line-height:1.45;margin:0;max-width:none;color:var(--tx)}\n</style>\n    <h2 class=\"\" style=\"left:39.003%;top:11.013%\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"390.03\" data-off-y=\"110.13\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Deux façons de penser</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\">Two ways of thinking</span></h2>\n    <div class=\"compare\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"220\" data-off-y=\"190\" style=\"left:22%;top:19%\">\n      <div class=\"col sys1\">\n        <img class=\"compare-img\" src=\"../medias/images/lievre.png\" alt=\"Lièvre\" onclick=\"Deck.next()\" style=\"cursor:pointer\">\n        <div class=\"dp-carte step\" data-order=\"1\">\n          <p class=\"lead dp-titre\" style=\"color:var(--acc2)\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Le système intuitif</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\">The intuitive system</span></p>\n          <p class=\"lead dp-texte\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Fonctionne vite !<br>Consomme peu d'énergie.<br>Peut faire des erreurs.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\">Works fast!<br>Uses little energy.<br>Can make mistakes.</span></p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col sys2\">\n        <img class=\"compare-img\" src=\"../medias/images/tortue.png\" alt=\"Tortue\" onclick=\"Deck.next()\" style=\"cursor:pointer\">\n        <div class=\"dp-carte step\" data-order=\"2\">\n          <p class=\"lead dp-titre\" style=\"color:var(--acc)\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Le système analytique</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\">The analytical system</span></p>\n          <p class=\"lead dp-texte\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Fonctionne lentement.<br>Consomme beaucoup d'énergie.<br>Est plus rationnel, plus analytique.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\">Works slowly.<br>Uses a lot of energy.<br>Is more rational, more analytical.</span></p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  "
