   "contentHtml": "\n  <h2 data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"285.45\" data-off-y=\"110.13\" style=\"left:28.545%;top:11.013%\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Quel est le lien entre ces différents médias ?</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\">What do these posts have in common?</span></h2>\n  <div class=\"vidwrap\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"390.91\" data-off-y=\"178.39\" style=\"left:39.091%;top:17.839%\"><video src=\"../medias/video/inf-lien-medias-3.mp4\" controls=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video></div>\n"
