   "contentHtml": "\n    <p class=\"kicker\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"427.03\" data-off-y=\"110.13\" style=\"left:42.703%;top:11.013%\"><span class=\"t-fr\">La question est vite répondue</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\">The question is quickly answered</span></p>\n    <h2 data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"309.29\" data-off-y=\"140.97\" style=\"left:30.929%;top:14.097%\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Le lifestyle comme preuve de réussite ?</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\">Lifestyle as proof of success?</span></h2>\n    <div class=\"vidwrap\" style=\"max-width: 395px;left:39.74%;top:20.923%;width:395px\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"397.4\" data-off-y=\"209.23\">\n      <video src=\"../medias/video/influenceur-finance-lac.mp4\" controls=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n    </div>\n  "
