   "contentHtml": "\n    <p class=\"kicker\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"455.83\" data-off-y=\"110.13\" style=\"left:45.583%;top:11.013%\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Illusion d'optique</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\">Optical illusion</span></p>\n    <h2 data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"269.5\" data-off-y=\"140.97\" style=\"left:26.95%;top:14.097%\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Les cases A et B sont-elles de la même couleur ?</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\">Are squares A and B the same colour?</span></h2>\n    <div class=\"illu-frame\" id=\"illu-frame-adelson\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"307.79\" data-off-y=\"215.84\" style=\"left:30.779%;top:21.584%\"><iframe src=\"https://antoninatger.github.io/jeux/Ilusions%20d'optique/adelson.html\" title=\"Échiquier d'Adelson\" loading=\"lazy\"></iframe></div>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"reveal-btn illu-fs-btn\" data-target=\"#illu-frame-adelson\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"467.39\" data-off-y=\"962.53\" style=\"left:46.739%;top:96.253%\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Plein écran</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\">Fullscreen</span></button>\n    <p class=\"lead media-note t-en\" hidden=\"\">This interactive illustration is in French.</p>\n  "
