   "contentHtml": "\n    <h2 data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"127.308\" data-off-y=\"88.889\" style=\"left:12.731%;top:8.889%;width:59.127%;max-width:none;font-size:61px\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Qu’est-ce qui ne va pas dans cette histoire ?</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></h2>\n    <p class=\"lead\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"127.308\" data-off-y=\"315.047\" style=\"left:12.731%;top:31.505%;width:59.127%;max-width:none;font-size:30px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">• Une personne recherche une dague magique.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <p class=\"lead\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"127.308\" data-off-y=\"374.518\" style=\"left:12.731%;top:37.452%;width:59.127%;max-width:none;font-size:30px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">• Elle marche sans encombre pendant une dizaine de jours. Elle recherche une dague magique pour sauver son village.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <p class=\"lead\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"127.308\" data-off-y=\"476.941\" style=\"left:12.731%;top:47.694%;width:59.127%;max-width:none;font-size:30px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">• Elle affronte plusieurs monstres et trouve la dague. Elle rentre chez elle. Fin.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <p class=\"lead\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"127.308\" data-off-y=\"579.364\" style=\"left:12.731%;top:57.936%;width:59.127%;max-width:none;font-size:30px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">• Qu’est ce qu’il manque ?</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n  "
