   "kind": "simple",
   "attrsRaw": "class=\"slide etudes\" id=\"masni-c1-etude-memoire\"",
   "contentHtml": "\n    <h2 data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"261.04\" data-off-y=\"110.13\" style=\"left:26.104%;top:11.013%\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Mémoire de travail, besoin de cognition et pensée complotiste</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></h2><div class=\"imgcard-full\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"344.16\" data-off-y=\"235.65\" style=\"left:34.416%;top:23.565%\"><img src=\"../medias/images/masni-etude-memoire-1.png\" alt=\"Résultats de l’étude sur la mémoire de travail\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"imgcard-full step\" data-order=\"1\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"332.61\" data-off-y=\"381.02\" style=\"left:33.261%;top:38.102%\"><img src=\"../medias/images/masni-etude-memoire-2.png\" alt=\"Résultats, suite\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"imgcard-full step\" data-order=\"2\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"328.21\" data-off-y=\"592.03\" style=\"left:32.821%;top:59.203%\"><img src=\"../medias/images/masni-etude-memoire-3.png\" alt=\"Résultats, suite\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"speaker-notes\" hidden=\"\">tandfonline.com/doi/full/10.1080/20445911.2024.2335108 ; Wagner-Egger et al., 2019 ; Brotherton &amp; French, 2015 ; Imhoff &amp; Bruder, 2014 ; Douglas et al., 2015 ; Tempel &amp; Alcock, 2015. Contre : Dieguez et al., 2015.</div>\n  "
