   "kind": "simple",
   "attrsRaw": "class=\"slide etudes\" id=\"masni-c1-mentalite-vs-croyances\"",
   "contentHtml": "\n    <p class=\"kicker\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"456.15\" data-off-y=\"110.13\" style=\"left:45.615%;top:11.013%\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Imhoff et al., 2022</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p><h2 data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"261.04\" data-off-y=\"140.97\" style=\"left:26.104%;top:14.097%\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Mentalité complotiste et croyances complotistes ne sont pas la même chose</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></h2><div class=\"imgcard-full\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"230.74\" data-off-y=\"266.49\" style=\"left:23.074%;top:26.649%\"><img src=\"../medias/images/masni-imhoff-titre.png\" alt=\"Titre de l’étude d’Imhoff et al.\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"imgcard-full step\" data-order=\"1\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"391.48\" data-off-y=\"477.49\" style=\"left:39.148%;top:47.749%\"><img src=\"../medias/images/masni-imhoff-1.png\" alt=\"Résultats\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"imgcard-full step\" data-order=\"2\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"390.43\" data-off-y=\"688.5\" style=\"left:39.043%;top:68.85%\"><img src=\"../medias/images/masni-imhoff-2.png\" alt=\"Résultats, suite\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"speaker-notes\" hidden=\"\">Tearing apart the “evil” twins: a general conspiracy mentality is not the same as specific conspiracy beliefs (Imhoff et al., 2022).</div>\n  "
