   "contentHtml": "\n    <h2 data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"440.78\" data-off-y=\"387.67\" style=\"left:44.078%;top:38.767%\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Le paradoxe</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></h2><p class=\"lead taille-l step\" data-order=\"1\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"323.96\" data-off-y=\"460.33\" style=\"left:32.396%;top:46.033%\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Certains politiciens fragilisent la société via le complotisme.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"lead taille-l step\" data-order=\"2\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"336.44\" data-off-y=\"519.8\" style=\"left:33.644%;top:51.98%\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Ces modifications sociétales renforcent le complotisme.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"lead taille-l step\" data-order=\"3\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"350.41\" data-off-y=\"579.27\" style=\"left:35.041%;top:57.927%\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Ce complotisme risque de profiter à ces politiciens.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n  "
