   "kind": "simple",
   "attrsRaw": "class=\"slide\" id=\"narrative-evolution-du-heros\"",
   "contentHtml": "\n    <h2 data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"259.061\" data-off-y=\"91.005\" style=\"left:25.906%;top:9.1%;width:61.294%;max-width:none;font-size:61px\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Evolution du héros</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></h2>\n    <p class=\"lead\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"134.561\" data-off-y=\"224.184\" style=\"left:13.456%;top:22.418%;width:72.326%;max-width:none;font-size:30px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">• A l’époque médiévale, le héros évolue : il devient plus humain.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <p class=\"lead\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"134.561\" data-off-y=\"283.655\" style=\"left:13.456%;top:28.365%;width:72.326%;max-width:none;font-size:30px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">• Ses forces premières sont : courage et fidélité.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <div class=\"imgcard\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"538.529\" data-off-y=\"508.311\" style=\"left:53.853%;top:50.831%;width:37.442%;max-width:none\"><img src=\"../medias/images/spiderman-017-10.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n    <div class=\"imgcard\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"167.501\" data-off-y=\"389.005\" style=\"left:16.75%;top:38.9%;width:19.274%;max-width:none\"><img src=\"../medias/images/spiderman-017-11.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n  "
