   "attrsRaw": "class=\"slide\" id=\"narrative-comment-se-construit-une-pub\"",
   "contentHtml": "\n    <p class=\"lead\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"282.39\" data-off-y=\"311.111\" style=\"left:28.239%;top:31.111%;width:59.319%;max-width:none;font-size:30px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">– Créer une situation qui va servir d’exemple (des femmes de toutes origines, de toutes religions, de toutes corpulences, cis ou trans, peuvent faire ce qu’elles veulent malgré les obstacles).</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <p class=\"lead\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"282.39\" data-off-y=\"456.486\" style=\"left:28.239%;top:45.649%;width:59.319%;max-width:none;font-size:30px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">– En conclusion : une morale qui permet de faire de l’exemple précédent une généralité :</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <p class=\"lead\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"282.39\" data-off-y=\"558.908\" style=\"left:28.239%;top:55.891%;width:59.319%;max-width:none;font-size:30px;text-align:left\"><span class=\"t-fr\">– (Conclusion implicite : achetez Adidas).</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n    <h2 data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"259.061\" data-off-y=\"91.005\" style=\"left:25.906%;top:9.1%;width:61.294%;max-width:none;font-size:61px\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Comment se construit une pub ?</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></h2>\n    <div class=\"imgcard\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"465.147\" data-off-y=\"541.279\" style=\"left:46.515%;top:54.128%;width:19.621%;max-width:none\"><img src=\"../medias/images/narrative-148-62.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n  "
