   "contentHtml": "\n    <h2 data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"303.31\" data-off-y=\"395.37\" style=\"left:30.331%;top:39.537%\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Comment on sait ce qui est vrai ou faux ?</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></h2><p class=\"lead taille-l step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"462.93\" data-off-y=\"468.04\" style=\"left:46.293%;top:46.804%\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Selon vous ?</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"lead taille-l step\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"302.6\" data-off-y=\"527.51\" style=\"left:30.26%;top:52.751%\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Est-ce qu’on peut se baser uniquement sur ce qu’on connaît NOUS ?</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\"></span></p>\n  "
