   "contentHtml": "\n    <h2 data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"407.56\" data-off-y=\"413\" style=\"left:40.756%;top:41.3%\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Les biais cognitifs !</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\">Cognitive biases!</span></h2>\n    <p class=\"lead\" style=\"color:var(--acc);font-weight:800;left:34.249%;top:48.566%\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"342.49\" data-off-y=\"485.66\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Une distorsion dans le traitement « cognitif » d'une information.</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\">A distortion in how our brain \"cognitively\" processes information.</span></p>\n    <a class=\"gamelink\" href=\"https://antoninatger.github.io/jeux/Biais%20cognitifs/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" data-pose=\"\" data-off-x=\"406.48\" data-off-y=\"545.13\" style=\"left:40.648%;top:54.513%\"><span class=\"t-fr\">Explorer tous les biais cognitifs sur Perceptio</span><span class=\"t-en\" hidden=\"\">Explore all cognitive biases on Perceptio</span></a>\n  "
